sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Provider
    participant Q as Queue
    participant R as Receiver endpoint
    P->>Q: Event created
    Q->>R: POST /hook + X-Signature + event id
    Note right of R: Verify HMAC + timestamp<br/>Dedupe by event id
    R-->>Q: 2xx fast, process async
    Q->>R: Retry with backoff on non-2xx or timeout
    Note over Q: After N failures: dead-letter and disable endpoint
